OL,3,AHospital admits full responsibility for
OL,4,A24 failures that led to toddler's death
OL,5,
OL,6,FA hospital trust has taken full
OL,7,Fresponsibility for 24 failures that led
OL,8,Fto the death of a 21-month-old.
OL,10,FEleanor Hazel Aldred-Owen died at
OL,11,FLiverpool's Alder Hey Hospital on 2
OL,12,FOctober 2023 - a coroner concluded she
OL,13,Fdied as a result of misadventure,
OL,14,Fcontributed to by neglect.
OL,16,FShe had routine surgery for
OL,17,Fcraniosynostosis, a birth defect
OL,18,Faffecting the skull, but an abnormal
OL,19,Fchest X-ray was not flagged.
OL,23,APub: 31-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
